Director, Business Development - EMEA &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Tenstorrent is leading the industry on cutting-edge AI technology, revolutionizing performance expectations, ease of use, and cost efficiency. With AI redefining the computing paradigm, solutions must evolve to unify innovations in software models, compilers, platforms, networking, and semiconductors. Our diverse team of technologists have developed a high performance RISC-V CPU from scratch, and share a passion for AI and a deep desire to build the best AI platform possible. We value collaboration, curiosity, and a commitment to solving hard problems. We are growing our team and looking for contributors of all seniorities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Tenstorrent builds open, scalable AI compute, and Europe is a priority market for revenue growth. As BD Executive, Europe, you will own business development across the UK, Germany, France and other EU countries, deepening existing engagements and opening new ones with enterprise and government clients and system integrators. You will work with the International GTM team, partners and customers to turn technical interest in our hardware into commercial opportunities. This is a senior role on a team that may grow as the region does.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is remote, based out of London, Frankfurt, or another major EU city with required travel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome candidates at various experience levels for this role. During the interview process, candidates will be assessed for the appropriate level, and offers will align with that level, which may differ from the one in this posting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales or business development leader with 10+ years of experience in solution selling for AI hardware, HPC or similar technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trusted by government and enterprise clients and system integrators, with strong relationships you can bring into new conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven in building pipeline and closing commercial opportunities, from first meeting through signed deal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English, with German, French or another EU language as a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage pipeline across the UK, Germany, France and other EU countries, growing existing engagements and opening new ones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own client relationships with enterprise, government and system integrator accounts, coordinating several stakeholders per initiative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across borders with GTM, partner and technical teams so each opportunity has the right support to close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report on region pipeline and market trends so the team can focus on the deals most likely to land.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Learn&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How Tenstorrent&#39;s open, scalable AI hardware fits enterprise, government and sovereign compute needs in Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ways to build a regional business at a fast-moving AI compute company, with room for the team to grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical depth on AI systems and software, with training from our GTM and field engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Where AI infrastructure demand is heading across the European market, from data center to cloud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tenstorrent offers a highly competitive compensation package and benefits, and we are an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This offer of employment is contingent upon the applicant being eligible to access U.S. export-controlled technology. &amp;nbsp;Due to U.S. export laws, including those codified in the U.S. Export Administration Regulations (EAR), the Company is required to ensure compliance with these laws when transferring technology to nationals of certain countries (such as EAR Country Groups D:1, E1, and E2). &amp;nbsp; These requirements apply to persons located in the U.S. and all countries outside the U.S. &amp;nbsp;As the position offered will have direct and/or indirect access to information, systems, or technologies subject to these laws, the offer may be contingent upon your citizenship/permanent residency status or ability to obtain prior license approval from the U.S. Commerce Department or applicable federal agency. &amp;nbsp;If employment is not possible due to U.S. export laws, any offer of employment will be rescinded.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Experience: GTM  Munich

Account Director &lt;h3&gt;About Ogilvy&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot; data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Ogilvy UK has been creating iconic ideas that deliver impact at scale for clients ever since David Ogilvy founded the company in 1948. Ogilvy UK specialises in bringing together brand advertising, customer experience marketing, PR, influence and consulting, all fuelled by Behavioural Science. Our world-class award-winning creative campaigns deliver solutions for clients including Sainsbury’s, Argos, , Mondelēz International, Unilever, TK Maxx and Pernod Ricard.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;In 2023, Ogilvy UK celebrated their&amp;nbsp;75th&amp;nbsp;anniversary and was the most awarded agency in Europe. Ogilvy is home to the largest influencer marketing practice globally, and hosts the world’s biggest festival of behavioural science and creativity,&amp;nbsp;Nudgestock&amp;nbsp;– now in its&amp;nbsp;12th&amp;nbsp;year&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the Role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead larger, multi-faceted projects, ensuring delivery aligns seamlessly with client ambitions and agency standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build enduring partnerships with mid-level clients founded on strategic clarity, mutual trust, and creative excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect strategic thinking with creative development, guiding teams to craft meaningful solutions to client challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support team development through coaching and mentorship, fostering an inclusive environment where individuals can grow and succeed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide thoughtful, steady leadership to anticipate project needs, resolve challenges collaboratively, and deliver high-quality work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted strategic advisor to clients, developing a deep understanding of their business goals, audience, and evolving market landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide the bridge between strategy and delivery, facilitating discussions that ensure creative ideas are grounded in robust, audience-focused insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute constructively to creative reviews, offering thoughtful feedback that enriches the work and enhances campaign effectiveness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee commercial health and financial management, including scope development, fee tracking, and project profitability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide multidisciplinary teams through the full delivery lifecycle, from initial concept development through to final production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and empower junior colleagues, providing regular feedback, encouragement, and opportunities to take on new responsibilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Model inclusive collaboration, clear accountability, and balanced perspective during busy, complex delivery cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead client-facing presentations and communications, representing the agency’s work with clarity, warmth, and strategic intent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate thoughtfully for account and team needs across the agency to ensure appropriate resourcing, wellbeing, and support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You&#39;ll Need&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience guiding complex client accounts and multi-channel creative projects within an agency setting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strategic mindset with the ability to connect commercial objectives to inspiring creative opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empathetic, supportive leadership skills that encourage collaboration, psychological safety, and shared team success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Constructive problem-solving abilities to anticipate risks early and navigate evolving priorities with composure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Well-honed organisational skills to coordinate multiple stakeholders, complex workflows, and key milestones smoothly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, engaging, and open communication skills for presenting concepts, facilitating discussions, and managing expectations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of the creative and production process, paired with an enthusiasm for championing bold, impactful work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial awareness with experience overseeing scopes of work, budgets, and overall project finances&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptability, emotional intelligence, and a dedicated commitment to championing client success and team growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days annual leave + 1 Volunteer Day &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bupa Healthcare&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced Maternity, Adoption and Shared Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have a Flexible Working Model with core working hours: 10am – 4pm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A 1.5:1 Matching Pension Structure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellbeing and Health: Up to £25.00 per month towards physical or online exercise class membership, Unmind membership, LifeWorks tool and annual eye tests and development budgets and Wellbeing incentives and activities throughout the year &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Season Ticket Loan and Cycle to Work Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Our ambition is to attract the very best diverse talent to Ogilvy, and to be the employer of choice in the UK. We want everyone to feel welcome when they join us, and once they’re here, for them to want to stay with us, grow their career, and to feel they belong with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNoSpacing&quot;&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and we’re committed to creating an inclusive, welcoming environment for everyone who wants to work at Ogilvy. For us, diversity, equity and inclusion is integrated into everything that we do. We believe that for creativity to flourish, everything about how we work must have diversity at its core. Your race, colour, ethnic, religion, gender, gender identity, national origin, sexual orientation, age, marital status, disability, have no bearing on our hiring decisions, but we encourage everyone to feel free to express their true selves in an environment we are consistently striving to make as inclusive as possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNoSpacing&quot;&gt;We aim to facilitate an accessible and positive application experience for all candidates. If you require any adjustments from us to support you through the process or expect to require any adjustments to working conditions to be able to best perform in the role, please let us know. We are happy to consider all reasonable adjustments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNoSpacing&quot;&gt;If you live with a disability and you would like to take advantage of our offer of a guaranteed interview under the Disability Confident Scheme, please ensure you fill out our voluntary Equal Opportunities Questionnaire when applying.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Account/Client Services  London

Principal Solutions Architect &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions designs, builds, and operates the growth systems that competitive businesses rely on. In a world where Al is reshaping how companies drive growth, we lead clients in business transformation and marketing modernization, connecting strategy directly to execution. Our 12,000 experts in engineering and platforms, commerce, consulting, content transformation, CRM, and CX work within a unified global operating unit across 40+ markets. WPP Enterprise Solutions works alongside best-in-class partners including Adobe, AWS, Braze, Google, Microsoft, Salesforce, and Shopify, as well as innovators in AI, to deliver growth solutions tailored to the needs of our clients’ businesses. VML, part of WPP, supports WPP Enterprise Solutions by helping brands activate transformation through creativity and experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our Commerce &amp;amp; Technology division helps leading global brands design, build and run the commerce platforms behind their growth. We are seeking a Principal Solutions Architect to lead solution in business pursuits and account growth, across enterprise commerce.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will be the person in the room who understands how the whole commerce estate fits together, from web storefront and mobile app through commerce platform, data and ERP.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; You will turn that understanding into a clear case for business value, win the trust of senior client stakeholders, and when it helps, build a working demonstration to show them what good looks like.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
