&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Find the tension:&lt;/strong&gt; Turn complexity into clarity. Find the sharpest insights, the most interesting tensions, and the questions that unlock new possibilities for brands and businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Craft the springboard:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop strategic briefs, provocations, narratives, and thought-starters that inspire creative teams, give ideas direction, and make brilliant work possible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Invent growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Look beyond the brief and beyond the boundaries of traditional marketing. Identify new opportunities for clients, connect disciplines, and help shape bigger, more ambitious growth challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Think horizontally:&lt;/strong&gt; Move comfortably across brand, creative, social, digital, media, technology, and experience. You don&#39;t need to be an expert in everything, but you know how to connect the dots and bring the right people together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Embrace what&#39;s next:&lt;/strong&gt; Explore how emerging technologies, AI, and the evolving roles of humans and agents are reshaping customer journeys, business operations, and the opportunities for our clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Move at pace:&lt;/strong&gt; Be comfortable with ambiguity, trust your instincts, and get hands-on. You know when to dig deeper, when to challenge the obvious, and when to get a good idea out into the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elevate the floor:&lt;/strong&gt; Bring your experience, point of view, and curiosity to the wider team. Challenge the thinking, inspire the people around you, and help make the work (and the people around you) better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That&#39;s the core of it. Beyond that, we&#39;re looking for someone who cares deeply about the craft of strategy, the power of creativity, and the potential of people and businesses. Someone with a point of view, a healthy disregard for convention, and the energy to help build something new.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic craft:&lt;/strong&gt; 10+ years of experience, ideally gained in leading creative agencies. You have strong foundations in brand and creative strategy, and the work to show for it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creative instinct:&lt;/strong&gt; You know what makes an idea interesting, unexpected, and powerful. You can spot the potential in a thought and help turn it into work people care about.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A broader horizon:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re as interested in what happens beyond advertising as you are in advertising itself. Social, digital, media, technology, business, culture: it&#39;s all part of the picture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connected thinking:&lt;/strong&gt; You don&#39;t think in silos. You connect the dots between audience, brand, business, culture, competition, capability, and creativity to find opportunities for growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cultural fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a deep understanding of British (advertising) culture and an instinct for what&#39;s shifting in the world around us. You&#39;re curious about people, platforms, movements, and the things shaping what comes next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An appetite for what&#39;s next:&lt;/strong&gt; You’re interested in how AI, new technologies, and changing behaviours are creating new opportunities for brands and businesses. You&#39;re willing to explore, experiment, and challenge your own thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entrepreneurial spirit:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re not waiting for the perfect brief or the next big assignment. You spot opportunities, make things happen, and bring energy to building something new.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A point of view:&lt;/strong&gt; You have your own perspective on strategy, creativity, and the industry. You&#39;re confident enough to challenge convention, open enough to change your mind, and curious enough to keep learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; You lead through the work. You&#39;re as comfortable getting stuck into a brief, shaping a thought, or working alongside a creative team as you are guiding a room or presenting a bigger vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team player:&lt;/strong&gt; You know the best work comes from bringing people together. You collaborate generously, challenge constructively, and leave egos at the door. You&#39;re interested in bigger challenges, not bigger titles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WE OFFER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A flexible, hybrid working policy (2-3 days from the office, depending on location) and the opportunity to work from abroad for 13 weeks a year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;24 vacation days per year and the possibility to buy an unlimited number of extra vacation days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DEPT®/YOU Learning Menu and DEPT®/YOU Special Programs. Develop your skills with courses and programs tailored to your needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay happy and healthy with a contribution to your health through the OpenUp platform, gym and wellness discounts, and healthy lunches at the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get a discount on your lease bike and ride in style. You can also enjoy hassle free-commutes with an NS Business Card.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A reputation for doing good. DEPT® has been a Certified B Corp® since 2021, has been named a&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.greatplacetowork.nl/en/certification/certified/dept&quot;&gt; Great Place To Work since 2022&lt;/a&gt; in the Netherlands and named ‘Agency of the Year’ at both The Lovies and The Webby Awards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awesome clients. Whether big, small, local or global — at DEPT® you’ll get the opportunity to work with all of them. And we celebrate all of our successes together!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can discover even more employee benefits&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deptagency.com/nl-nl/employee-benefits/&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY DEPT®?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a Growth Invention company built to help the world’s most ambitious brands grow faster. Operating at the intersection of technology and marketing, we create what is next by pioneering ideas, acting fast, and moving further because standing still just is not in our DNA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are drawn to people who stay curious, move with intent, and never stop inventing. Our culture runs on three values: better together, relentlessly curious, and get sh*t done. It is how we work, how we grow, and how we make things that matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DEPT®, you will find the freedom to explore, the space to collaborate, and the trust to make a real impact for our clients, for each other, and for the world we are helping to build.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DIVERSITY, EQUITY &amp;amp; INCLUSION&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DEPT®, we take pride in creating an inclusive workplace where everyone has an equal opportunity to thrive. We actively seek to recruit, develop, nurture, and retain talented individuals from diverse backgrounds, with varying skills and perspectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Not sure you meet all qualifications? Apply, and let us decide! Research shows that women and members of underrepresented groups tend not to apply for jobs when they think they may not meet every requirement, when in fact they do. We believe in giving everyone a fair chance to shine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also encourage you to reach out to us and discuss any reasonable adjustments we can make to support you throughout the recruitment process and your time with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Want to know more about our dedication to diversity, equity, and inclusion? Check out our efforts&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deptagency.com/the-good-company/&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
